3.1 Test Set
In order to evaluate these types of hallucinations LLMs generate when translating into Irish, we conducted a preliminary pilot test. We identified that general texts (such as general news from the WMT corpora) did not produce any of these hallucinations. However, domain-specific texts, particularly those in scientific and medical fields containing a higher frequency of unfamiliar terms, showed noticeable examples of these hallucinations. Based on
